# Swarm ownership

Read `.cursor/scenarios.json` and the named skill under `.cursor/skills/` before writing code.

- One scenario per subagent. Do not implement a sibling scenario.
- Stay inside that scenario's `allowedPaths`. Create files there; do not edit hotspots.
- Hotspots (orchestrator only): `src/app/app.routes.ts`, `src/app/app.config.ts`, `src/styles.scss`, `src/app/core/layout/**`, `api/src/app.module.ts`, `api/src/mikro-orm.config.ts`, `shared/activity/**`, `shared/xp/**`.
- Import `ActivityBus` and emit events. Never write `XpLedger` or `Streak` from a feature module.
- Import DTOs from `@ascend-os/shared`. Do not duplicate event/XP types.
- Global CLIs only: `ng` and `nest`. No `npx @angular/cli` / `npx @nestjs/cli`. No second `ng new`.
- Angular: standalone, SCSS, `--skip-tests` unless asked. Export `*.routes.ts` from the feature folder.
- Nest: entities as `*.entity.ts` under your module so Mikro glob picks them up.
- UI source of truth: `.cursor/references/DESIGN.md` + `.cursor/references/personal-os/`. PrimeNG 22 only — map Personal OS layout onto PrimeNG. Tokens: `#111110` / `#191918` / `#222221` / `#0091ff`, Geist. Do not rebuild tables, dialogs, tabs, toasts, or meters.
- Do not wait for other agents. Stub against existing contracts if a neighbor is unfinished.
- Do not commit, push, or run `ng serve` / long-lived servers.
